---
title: "payout_criteria_validation (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_valid_issues: count watson lifetime valid issues
    q_check_valid_issues --> q_gate1_pass: valid_issues >= 2
    q_check_valid_issues --> q_gate1_fail: valid_issues < 2
    q_gate1_pass --> q_calc_ratio: compute issues_ratio
    q_gate1_fail --> q_withheld: USDC payouts withheld
    q_calc_ratio --> q_ratio: ratio = valid_issues / total_issues (lifetime, from July 2023)
    q_ratio --> q_gate2_pass: ratio >= 0.20
    q_ratio --> q_gate2_fail: ratio < 0.20
    q_gate2_pass --> q_eligible: watson eligible for USDC payout
    q_gate2_fail --> q_withheld: USDC payouts withheld
    q_eligible --> [*]: payout released
    q_withheld --> q_future: payouts accumulate until criteria met
    q_future --> q_check_valid_issues: re-evaluate after next contest
    q_future --> [*]: payouts released when both criteria met

    note right of q_check_valid_issues
        INV-001: Gate 1 - Minimum 2 valid issues lifetime (all-time)
        INV-002: Prevents mass sybil accounts with 1 issue each
    end note

    note right of q_ratio
        INV-003: Gate 2 - Issues ratio >= 20% (valid / total)
        INV-004: Ratio computed from contests starting July 1, 2023 onward
        INV-005: Withheld payouts are released in full once both criteria met
    end note
